    "detailed_description": "The last seed of a decayed forest journeys to breathe life into the stolen paradise. In FUZZ you'll fly through a land of whimsical nature and lost technology, engage in fluid aerial combat, and use the world around you to unlock new areas and conquer challenges.<br />\r\n* Gather the forces of nature, technology, and spirit by flying through the environment and pulling items and elements into your Gale.<br />\r\n* Use the Tether to tie objects together or pull things apart.<br />\r\n* Travel to 5 unique environments, each full of new challenges, new weapons and tools, new ecosystems, and old mysteries.",
